--- make
description: A seeder in database/seeders: a script that fills the database with records, run by kscript db seed
category: Scripts and data
usage: <name>
example: kscript make seeder users
to: {{ paths.seeders }}/{{ dir }}{{ kebab }}{{ ext }}
hint: Fill it in, then run kscript db seed {{ kebab }} (or kscript db fresh --seed to start again with it).
---
// {{ title }}: run by kscript db seed. Import the models it makes records of, then make them:
// import "{{ up }}{{ paths.models }}/user{{ ext }}"
// User->create(name: 'Ada', email: 'ada@example.com')
